129:1. **P1 main shell** `parts/main-shell.mjs`: ground grass; floors (y=0, y=5 with the foyer void), walls y1..9 of M, W, T (with the chamfer), top plate y=9, interior partitions and all openings/voids from OPENINGS; foyer stair; quoins and shutters via `wallBlock`/`shutterCells`; floors per room. Ticks 3, 6, 9, 10, 11, 15, 22.
